title: Stage what you mean to commit
title-zh: 暂存你想提交的内容
---
> mkdir recipes
> cd recipes
> git init
+hidden README.md
# Family recipes

Recipes we cook again and again.
+end
> git add README.md
> git commit -m "Add a README"
+file pancakes.md
# Pancakes

- 200 g flour
- 2 eggs
- 300 ml milk
+end
+file README.md
# Family recipes

Recipes we cook again and again, with notes on what worked.
+end
$ git status
$ git add pancakes.md
$ git status
$ git commit -m "Add a pancake recipe"
$ git status
$ git add README.md
$ git commit -m "Say what the notes are for"
$ git log --oneline
@graph three-commits
